 "sarvam_vocals": {
  "text": "Motion, motion, change in position of an object with time. Velocity, acceleration along a straight line. Come and do everything in the universe motion, motion. We walk, we ride a bicycle, we run, sleep and air moves into and out of our lungs, blood flows in arteries and veins. Carry people, automobiles and planes, water flowing down a dam, these falling from trees. Earth rotates once every 24 hours, revolves 'round the sun once in a year. The sun in motion in the Milky Way, Milky Way moving within its local group of galaxies. Rectilinear motion, uniform acceleration, a set of simple equations. Relative motion of motion, relative velocity. Point objects valid so far as size is much smaller than the distance it moves in a reasonable duration of time. Real life, good number of situations, size neglected without much error. Motion, motion, change in position of an object with time, velocity, acceleration along a straight line.",
